.TH "heartburn-by-thetourist" "6" "2026-11-14" "Heartburn User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
heartburn-by-thetourist - the command to run Heartburn.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
heartburn-by-thetourist
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Heartburn is a 4k intro released by The Tourist in august 2013.
Ended 2nd at Buenzli 2013 (combined 64k/4k compo).
.PP
TheT(ourist) [Code]
.PP
The intro needs OpenGL 4.0.
It starts in a 1680x1050 window and stops by itself after about 75
seconds.
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
This program has no options.
.SH KEYS
.TP
F
switch between window and fullscreen (desktop resolution).
.TP
Escape, Q
quit the intro.
Closing the window also quits.
.SH NOTES
.PP
The original Linux binaries were built for a single resolution each.
The Debian version is compiled from the sources: the window can be
resized and the picture keeps the real aspect ratio of the window.
V-Sync is enabled.
.PP
The frame rate is printed on the standard output while the intro runs.
.SH INFOS
.PP
https://www.pouet.net/prod.php?which=61809
.SH BUGS
.PP
